    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "\nAs per https://pytorch.org/get-started/locally/\n\nCorrect pip install command for CUDA 12.4 builds are:\n```\npip3 install torch \n```\nor\n```\npip install torch --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu124\n```\n\nThis is related to Special Wheel built for Colab integration:\nhttps://github.com/googlecolab/colabtools/issues/5045#issue-2788233189\n\nWe need to strip from including this wheel:\nhttps://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu124_full/torch-2.6.0%2Bcu124-cp311-cp311-linux_x86_64.whl#sha256=0851a56527529b135e1f44e6b5826effb8f6a19368d9eaba9104d94a7b21affc\n\nin the https://download.pytorch.org/whl/torch/index.html",
